  - Match `- ` bullets only.
  - Bold form: `^- \*\*([^*]+)\*\*:?(.*)$` → `label` = trimmed label with optional trailing colon stripped from label token; `description` = trimmed suffix after bold span; `display_text` = `f"{label}: {description}"` when suffix non-empty else `label`; truncate before redaction in render path.
  - Plain form: `^- (.+)$` when bold regex does not match → `label` = `""`; `description` = trimmed body; `display_text` = truncated body; `dedupe_key` = normalized plain text.
  - Return `None` for empty bodies.
- **Markdown aggregator** (`parse_markdown_execution_issues(text: str) -> IssueDetailGroups`):
  - Walk sections fence-aware.
  - Parse in-scope bullets, collapse by `dedupe_key`, preserve first-seen order.
